        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Complexity due to varying user preferences, dynamic requirements for data masking. On-the-go masking poses risks, such as potential jailbreaks, and may lead to context loss if not implemented carefully.",
