              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Decisions: Emphasize masking sensitive information while preserving document context. Consider both document-level and on-the-go masking, prioritizing sensitive fields like account numbers, names, to maintain privacy without losing necessary context.",
